/cliamp-rpcd
/dist/

# A release binary carries git's view of the tree at the moment it was built,
# and release.yml writes the amd64 archive into dist/ before it builds arm64.
# Left untracked, that archive made every arm64 release claim a dirty tree.
#
# Design specs and plans are working notes for the change in progress, not part
# of the shipped tree. They are written under docs/superpowers/ by the spec-driven
# workflow and must not be committed.
/docs/superpowers/
